  "remarks": "JSC Coalmetbank is a regional commercial bank headquartered in the Chelyabinsk region of the Russian Federation. The banking sector is a sector providing substantial revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, JSC Coalmetbank is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
